OCPP JSON Schemas — Attribution
================================
These JSON Schema files are the official Open Charge Alliance (OCA) OCPP message
schemas, vendored VERBATIM (unmodified) from the public repository:
  https://github.com/juherr/awesome-ev-charging  @ commit 24fed58f64ec71fddd3e61f0300af13598b7d7c8
which keeps the OCA downloads byte for byte (line endings included); the
README.md of each source folder names the OCA file and its SHA-256:
  v16  <- ocpp/OCPP-1.6/schemas/json/
          (OCPP 1.6 documentation, OCA download of 2025-04)
       +  ocpp/Whitepapers/OCPP-1.6-security-whitepaper-edition-4/schema/
          (OCPP 1.6 Security Whitepaper edition 4)
  v201 <- ocpp/OCPP-2.0.1/OCPP-2.0.1_part3_JSON_schemas/
          (OCPP 2.0.1 part 3, 2020-03-31, as shipped with Edition 4)
  v21  <- ocpp/OCPP-2.1/OCPP-2.1_part3_JSON_schemas/
          (OCPP 2.1 part 3, 2025-01-23, as shipped with Edition 2)

